---
layout: layouts/page.njk
title: Portfolio
description: Artificial turf installations by PrimeTurf across Gauteng and the Western Cape. Residential lawns, putting greens, pool surrounds, play areas and before-and-after transformations.
eyebrow: Portfolio
heading: Transformations.
lede: Real PrimeTurf installations, photographed by our team. Filter by project type, and tap any photo to view it larger.
breadcrumbs:
  - label: Portfolio
scripts:
  - /assets/js/portfolio.js
---
<section class="section section--flush-top">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="pf-filters" role="group" aria-label="Filter projects" data-pf-filters>
      <button type="button" class="pf-chip" aria-pressed="true" data-filter="all">All <span class="pf-chip__n">{{ portfolio.total }}</span></button>
      {% for c in portfolio.categories %}
      <button type="button" class="pf-chip" aria-pressed="false" data-filter="{{ c.slug }}">{{ c.label }} <span class="pf-chip__n">{{ c.count }}</span></button>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    <p class="pf-status label" data-pf-status aria-live="polite">Showing {{ portfolio.total }} projects</p>

    <ul class="pf-grid" data-pf-grid>
      {% for it in portfolio.items %}
      <li class="pf-item" data-cats="{{ it.cats | join(' ') }}" data-index="{{ loop.index0 }}">
        <button type="button" class="pf-open" data-pf-open
          data-full="{{ it.img.full | htmlBaseUrl }}" data-caption="{{ it.caption }}" data-cat="{{ it.categoryLabel }}"
          {% if it.kind == "pair" %}data-before="{{ it.before.full | htmlBaseUrl }}" data-note="{{ it.note }}"{% endif %}
          aria-label="View larger: {{ it.caption }}">
          <img src="{{ it.img.src }}" srcset="{{ it.img.srcset }}" sizes="(max-width: 600px) 50vw, (max-width: 1000px) 33vw, 400px"
            width="{{ it.img.width }}" height="{{ it.img.height }}" alt="{{ it.alt }}" loading="{{ 'eager' if loop.index <= 6 else 'lazy' }}" decoding="async">
          {% if it.kind == "pair" %}<span class="pf-badge">Before &amp; after · drag</span>{% endif %}
        </button>
        <p class="pf-cap"><span class="label">{{ it.categoryLabel }}</span>{{ it.caption }}</p>
      </li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>
    <div class="pf-more"><button type="button" class="btn btn--outline" data-pf-more hidden>Show more</button></div>
  </div>
</section>

<dialog class="pf-lightbox" data-pf-lightbox aria-label="Project photo">
  <div class="pf-lb__bar">
    <p class="pf-lb__count label" data-lb-count></p>
    <button type="button" class="pf-lb__btn" data-lb-close aria-label="Close">×</button>
  </div>
  <div class="pf-lb__stage" data-lb-stage></div>
  <div class="pf-lb__foot">
    <button type="button" class="pf-lb__btn" data-lb-prev aria-label="Previous photo">‹</button>
    <p class="pf-lb__cap"><span class="label" data-lb-cat></span><span data-lb-caption></span></p>
    <button type="button" class="pf-lb__btn" data-lb-next aria-label="Next photo">›</button>
  </div>
</dialog>
